<?php [$eventSql,$eventArgs]=financialEventsSql($from,$until);$payments=query("SELECT COALESCE(SUM(CASE WHEN action IN ('payment.paid','stock_exit.paid') THEN total ELSE 0 END),0) collected,COALESCE(SUM(CASE WHEN action IN ('payment.refunded','stock_exit.refunded') THEN total ELSE 0 END),0) refunded FROM ($eventSql) events",$eventArgs)->fetch();?>
<section class="panel"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>Naplata i povrat novca</h2><p>Web narudžbe i lične prodaje, prema datumu evidentirane finansijske radnje.</p></div><a class="btn secondary" href="?<?=e(http_build_query(['page'=>'reports','export'=>'payments','from'=>$from,'to'=>$to]))?>">Finansijska evidencija CSV ↗</a></div><div class="report-totals"><div><span>Evidentirane naplate</span><strong><?=money((float)$payments['collected'])?></strong></div><div><span>Evidentirani povrati</span><strong><?=money((float)$payments['refunded'])?></strong></div></div><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Datum radnje</th><th>Izvor / dokument</th><th>Primalac</th><th>Radnja</th><th>Iznos</th><th>Obrazloženje</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach(query("SELECT * FROM ($eventSql) events ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 200",$eventArgs)->fetchAll() as $event):$paid=in_array($event['action'],['payment.paid','stock_exit.paid'],true);?><tr><td><?=e($event['created_at'])?></td><td><a href="?page=<?=$event['source']==='order'?'order':'exits'?>&id=<?=$event['record_id']?>"><?=$event['source']==='order'?'Narudžba':'Lična prodaja / izlaz'?> #<?=$event['record_id']?></a></td><td><?=e($event['recipient'])?></td><td><span class="status-badge <?=$paid?'status-paid':'status-refunded'?>"><?=$paid?'Naplata':'Povrat novca'?></span></td><td class="numeric"><?=money((float)$event['total'])?></td><td><?=e($event['details'])?></td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table></div><p class="field-help">Do 200 posljednjih radnji u periodu; CSV sadrži sve rezultate. Iznosi web narudžbi uključuju dostavu. Svaki povrat novca je odvojen zapis. Evidencija je ručna, bez djelimičnih uplata i automatske bankovne/kurirske potvrde.</p></section>
